The hubdouble binary in this image contains xdiff, the diff library that
libgit2 bundles in deps/xdiff (see deps/xdiff/xdiff.h):

    Copyright (C) 2003  Davide Libenzi

xdiff is free software under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version. The license text is
in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES, under LGPL-2.1-or-later.

The binary links xdiff statically. The complete source of this binary,
with xdiff and every other crate that it uses, is in the image

    ghcr.io/bartsmykla/hubdouble-source:@VERSION@

which is published in the same registry as this image. That image holds
one file, hubdouble-source.tar. To copy it out:

    id=$(docker create ghcr.io/bartsmykla/hubdouble-source:@VERSION@ x)
    docker cp "$id":/hubdouble-source.tar .
    docker rm "$id"

The BUILD file in the archive gives the command that rebuilds the binary
without network access, and the steps that relink it with a changed
xdiff.
